<title>UK: Burton buys Racing Green for 19 mln stg.</title>
<headline>Burton buys Racing Green for 19 mln stg.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Burton Group said on Monday it bought Racing Green, a mail order and retail business in casual wear, for 19 million stg.  </p>
<p>To help finance the acquisition, Burton issued 2.69 million new shares, worth a total four million stg.</p>
<p>Racing Green will be managed within Bruton's Home Shopping division, reporting to Richard Maney.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
